=== prompt
Map colour names to codes: "red" is 1, "green" is 2, anything else is 0. For the colours "green", "blue", "red" (in that order), log each code on its own line.
=== expected
2
0
1
=== reference
["green" "blue" "red"] = xs
0 >= i
Repeat({
  xs | Take(i) | Match(["red" {1} "green" {2} none {0}] passthrough: false) | Log
  Inc(i)
} times: 3)
